const navItems=[['Overview','◫'],['Assets','▣'],['Findings','⚑'],['Events','◷'],['Correlations','⌘'],['Investigations','◎'],['Remediation','↗'],['Audit Trail','≋'],['Settings','⚙'],['About','ⓘ']];
const collections=['assets','findings','events','correlations','investigations','remediations','audit','settings'];
const state={page:'Overview',data:{},query:'',selected:null,correlationFilter:'All',demo:null,graphScale:1,sidebarCollapsed:false,loading:false,loaded:false,sorts:{events:{key:'time',direction:'desc'}}};
const DISCLAIMER="CyberRakshak provides security analysis and remediation guidance based on the information available. Its findings and proposed actions may be incomplete or inaccurate, and successful remediation is not guaranteed.\n\nActions may affect system availability, data, or network operations. Review and approve changes before execution. For confirmed or potentially serious incidents, consult a qualified cybersecurity professional.\n\nA 'verified' relationship means the available evidence supports a connection; it does not necessarily mean a system has been compromised.";
const $=s=>document.querySelector(s), esc=s=>String(s??'').replace(/[&<>"']/g,c=>({'&':'&amp;','<':'&lt;','>':'&gt;','"':'&quot;',"'":'&#39;'}[c]));
const id=prefix=>prefix+'-'+Math.random().toString(36).slice(2,7).toUpperCase(), now=()=>new Date().toLocaleString();
const API_BASE=(document.querySelector('meta[name="api-base-url"]')?.content||'').replace(/\/$/,'');
async function api(path,opts={}){let r=await fetch(`${API_BASE}/api/${path}`,{headers:{'Content-Type':'application/json'},...opts});let data=await r.json().catch(()=>({error:'Invalid server response'}));if(!r.ok)throw Error(data.error||`Request failed (${r.status})`);return data}
async function refresh(){
  state.loading=true;render();
  try{let res=await Promise.all(collections.map(k=>api(k)));collections.forEach((k,i)=>state.data[k]=res[i]);state.error='';state.loaded=true}
  catch(e){state.error=e.message}
  finally{state.loading=false;render()}
  if(!state.error&&!localStorage.getItem('cr-onboarded'))showOnboarding()
}
function save(kind,obj){return api(kind,{method:'POST',body:JSON.stringify(obj)}).then(refresh)}
function status(s){let c=String(s).toLowerCase();if(c==='high'||c==='critical'||c==='open')c=c==='open'?'medium':c;return `<span class="badge ${esc(c)}">${esc(s)}</span>`}
function shell(){
  let isOpen=state.menu?'open':'',collapsed=state.sidebarCollapsed?'is-collapsed':'';
  return `<div class="shell ${collapsed}"><aside class="sidebar ${isOpen}" id="primary-nav"><div class="brand"><div class="logo" aria-hidden="true">C</div><div class="brand-copy"><b>CyberRakshak AI</b><small>Security workspace</small></div><button class="icon-button sidebar-collapse" onclick="toggleSidebar()" aria-label="${state.sidebarCollapsed?'Expand':'Collapse'} sidebar" aria-pressed="${state.sidebarCollapsed}"><span aria-hidden="true">${state.sidebarCollapsed?'»':'«'}</span></button></div><button class="workspace" onclick="navigate('Overview')" title="${esc(state.data.settings?.[0]?.name||'Northstar Dental Clinic')}"><span class="workspace-mark" aria-hidden="true">⌂</span><span class="workspace-copy"><small>WORKSPACE</small><strong>${esc(state.data.settings?.[0]?.name||'Northstar Dental Clinic')}</strong></span><span class="workspace-chevron" aria-hidden="true">⌄</span></button><div class="nav-label">Workspace</div><nav class="nav" aria-label="Workspace navigation">${navItems.map(([n,icon])=>`<button class="${state.page===n?'active':''}" ${state.page===n?'aria-current="page"':''} onclick="navigate('${n}')" title="${n}"><span class="nav-icon" aria-hidden="true">${icon}</span><span class="nav-text">${n}</span></button>`).join('')}</nav><div class="side-bottom"><span class="sim-dot"></span><span class="side-copy"><b>Simulation mode</b><small>Fictional evidence only</small></span></div></aside>${state.menu?'<button class="nav-scrim" onclick="toggleMenu()" aria-label="Close navigation"></button>':''}<main class="main"><header class="topbar"><div class="topbar-left"><button class="icon-button mobile-menu" onclick="toggleMenu()" aria-label="Open navigation" aria-expanded="${!!state.menu}" aria-controls="primary-nav">☰</button><div class="top-context"><span class="top-context-label">SECURITY WORKSPACE</span><b>${esc(state.page==='Overview'?'Command center':state.page)}</b></div><label class="search-wrap"><span aria-hidden="true">⌕</span><input class="search" placeholder="Search assets, findings, events…" value="${esc(state.query)}" oninput="globalSearch(this.value)" aria-label="Search workspace"><kbd>⌘ K</kbd></label></div><div class="topright"><span class="status-pill"><i></i>SIMULATION</span><button class="icon-button health-action" onclick="checkHealth()" aria-label="Check API health" title="Check API health"><span aria-hidden="true">⌁</span></button>${state.loading&&state.loaded?'<span class="refresh-label">Refreshing…</span>':''}</div></header><div class="page">${state.error?`<div class="alert error-alert"><span class="alert-icon" aria-hidden="true">!</span><div><b>Workspace data could not be loaded</b><small>${esc(state.error)}</small></div><button class="btn small" onclick="refresh()">Retry</button></div>`:''}${state.demo?.waiting?`<div class="banner"><span class="sim-dot"></span><b>Guided demo paused at ${demoSteps[state.demo.step][0]}</b><button class="btn small primary" style="margin-left:auto" onclick="resumeDemo()">Return to walkthrough</button></div>`:''}${pageContent()}</div></main></div><div id="modal-root"></div>`
}
function head(title,desc,buttons=''){return `<div class="page-head"><div><div class="eyebrow">NORTHSTAR DENTAL CLINIC / ${esc(state.page.toUpperCase())}</div><h1>${title}</h1><p class="sub">${desc}</p></div><div class="actions">${buttons}</div></div>`}
const btn=(label,fn,kind='')=>`<button class="btn ${kind}" onclick="${fn}">${label}</button>`;
function pageContent(){
  if(state.loading&&!state.loaded)return `<section class="skeleton-page" aria-label="Loading workspace data"><div class="skeleton-line wide"></div><div class="skeleton-line short"></div><div class="skeleton-grid">${[1,2,3,4].map(()=>'<div class="skeleton-card"></div>').join('')}</div><div class="skeleton-panel"></div></section>`;
  if(state.error&&!state.loaded)return head('Workspace unavailable','The API did not return workspace data. Retry after the server is available.');
  switch(state.page){case'Overview':return overview();case'Assets':return assetsPage();case'Findings':return findingsPage();case'Events':return eventsPage();case'Correlations':return correlationsPage();case'Investigations':return investigationsPage();case'Remediation':return remediationPage();case'Audit Trail':return auditPage();case'Settings':return settingsPage();default:return aboutPage()}
}
const byId=(kind,id)=>state.data[kind]?.find(x=>x.id===id), val=(v,f='—')=>esc(v||f);
function eventAnalytics(events){
  if(!events.length)return `<div class="chart-empty"><span class="empty-orbit">∅</span><b>No event data yet</b><span>Event charts will appear when the API returns records.</span></div>`;
  const severity=[['Critical','#ff647c'],['High','#ff9b68'],['Medium','#f4c45e'],['Low','#67c9ef']];
  const counts=severity.map(([name,color])=>({name,color,count:events.filter(e=>String(e.severity||'').toLowerCase()===name.toLowerCase()).length}));
  let offset=0;const stops=counts.map(x=>{const start=offset;offset+=x.count/events.length*100;return `${x.color} ${start}% ${offset}%`}).join(',');
  const days=Object.entries(events.reduce((all,e)=>{const day=String(e.time||'').slice(0,10);if(/^\d{4}-\d{2}-\d{2}$/.test(day))all[day]=(all[day]||0)+1;return all},{})).sort(([a],[b])=>a.localeCompare(b)).slice(-7);
  const max=Math.max(1,...days.map(([,n])=>n));
  return `<div class="analytics-grid"><div class="severity-chart-wrap"><button class="severity-donut" style="--donut:conic-gradient(${stops})" onclick="navigate('Events')" aria-label="${events.length} events across severities"><span><b>${events.length}</b><small>events</small></span></button><div class="chart-legend">${counts.filter(x=>x.count).map(x=>`<button onclick="showEventSeverity('${x.name}')"><i style="--legend:${x.color}"></i><span>${x.name}</span><b>${x.count}</b></button>`).join('')}</div></div><div class="activity-chart"><div class="chart-caption"><span>Events by recorded date</span><span class="chart-unit">${days.length?`${days.length} date${days.length===1?'':'s'}`:'No dated records'}</span></div>${days.length?`<div class="bar-chart" role="img" aria-label="Event counts grouped by dates recorded in the API"><div class="bar-guides"><i></i><i></i><i></i></div>${days.map(([day,count])=>`<button class="bar-column" onclick="showEventDate('${day}')" title="${count} event${count===1?'':'s'} on ${day}"><span class="bar-value">${count}</span><span class="bar-track"><i style="height:${Math.max(8,count/max*100)}%"></i></span><span class="bar-label">${esc(day.slice(5))}</span></button>`).join('')}</div>`:`<div class="chart-empty compact"><b>No dated events</b><span>Records without timestamps are omitted from this chart.</span></div>`}</div></div>`
}
function showEventSeverity(severity){state.eventSeverity=severity;navigate('Events')}
function showEventDate(date){state.eventDate=date;navigate('Events')}
function clearEventFilters(){state.eventType='';state.eventSeverity='';state.eventDate='';state.localQuery='';render()}
function overview(){
  const d=state.data,a=d.assets||[],f=d.findings||[],c=d.correlations||[],r=d.remediations||[],events=d.events||[];
  const open=f.filter(x=>x.status==='Open').length,high=f.filter(x=>['High','Critical'].includes(x.severity)).length,pending=r.filter(x=>['Pending Approval','Verification Pending','Requires Review'].includes(x.status)).length,verified=c.filter(x=>x.classification==='Verified').length;
  const recent=events.slice().sort((x,y)=>String(y.time||'').localeCompare(String(x.time||''))).slice(0,5);
  return `${head('Security overview','Evidence-led visibility across your workspace.',`${btn('▶ Guided demo','startDemo()','primary')}${btn('↻ Re-evaluate links','runCorrelation()')}`)}<div class="banner simulation-banner"><span class="sim-dot"></span><div><b>Simulation workspace</b><small>All assets, events, and remediation outcomes are fictional. No real system is scanned or changed.</small></div><button class="text-action" onclick="navigate('About')">About this workspace <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></button></div><div class="grid metrics"><article class="card metric-card"><div class="metric-label">Monitored assets <span class="metric-icon cyan">▣</span></div><div class="metric-value">${a.length}</div><div class="metric-note">Inventory records</div></article><article class="card metric-card"><div class="metric-label">Open findings <span class="metric-icon coral">⚑</span></div><div class="metric-value">${open}</div><div class="metric-note"><b>${high}</b> high or critical · review evidence</div></article><article class="card metric-card"><div class="metric-label">Evidence links <span class="metric-icon violet">⌘</span></div><div class="metric-value">${c.length}</div><div class="metric-note"><b>${verified}</b> verified relationships</div></article><article class="card metric-card"><div class="metric-label">Needs review <span class="metric-icon amber">◷</span></div><div class="metric-value">${pending}</div><div class="metric-note">Remediation decisions pending</div></article></div><div class="grid overview-main"><section class="card chart-card"><div class="section-heading"><div><span class="eyebrow">TELEMETRY SNAPSHOT</span><h2>Event analytics</h2><p>Distribution calculated from API event records</p></div><button class="text-action" onclick="navigate('Events')">View events <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></button></div>${eventAnalytics(events)}</section><section class="card risk-card"><div class="section-heading"><div><span class="eyebrow">EVIDENCE SUMMARY</span><h2>Finding severity</h2><p>Current API findings by severity</p></div><span class="section-icon">◈</span></div>${f.length?`<div class="risk-total"><b>${f.length}</b><span>recorded findings</span></div><div class="risk-list">${[['Critical','critical'],['High','high'],['Medium','medium'],['Low','low']].map(([label,key])=>{let n=f.filter(x=>String(x.severity||'').toLowerCase()===key).length;return `<button onclick="navigate('Findings');state.severity='${label}';render()"><span class="risk-dot ${key}"></span><span>${label}</span><b>${n}</b><i class="risk-track"><em class="${key}" style="width:${Math.round(n/f.length*100)}%"></em></i></button>`}).join('')}</div>`:`<div class="chart-empty"><span class="empty-orbit">∅</span><b>No findings returned</b><span>Severity summary will populate from API records.</span></div>`}</section></div><div class="grid overview-main overview-lower"><section class="card"><div class="section-heading"><div><span class="eyebrow">RELATIONSHIP REVIEW</span><h2>Priority relationships</h2></div><button class="text-action" onclick="navigate('Correlations')">All relationships <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></button></div>${c.slice(0,4).map(x=>`<button class="relationship-row" onclick="selectCorrelation('${x.id}');navigate('Correlations')"><span class="relationship-mark">⌁</span><span class="row-main"><b>${val(entityName(x.source))} <span class="muted">→</span> ${val(entityName(x.target))}</b><small>${esc(x.explanation)}</small></span>${status(x.classification)}</button>`).join('')||empty('No relationships evaluated yet. Run correlation to review the available evidence.')}</section><section class="card"><div class="section-heading"><div><span class="eyebrow">LATEST RECORDS</span><h2>Recent events</h2></div><button class="text-action" onclick="navigate('Events')">Event log <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></button></div>${recent.map(x=>`<button class="event-row" onclick="detail('events','${x.id}')"><span class="event-marker ${String(x.severity||'').toLowerCase()}"></span><span class="row-main"><b>${esc(x.name)}</b><small>${esc(x.time)} · ${esc(entityName(x.assetId))}</small></span>${status(x.severity)}</button>`).join('')||empty('No event records are available.')}</section></div><div class="grid overview-main overview-lower"><section class="card"><div class="section-heading"><div><span class="eyebrow">ANALYST QUEUE</span><h2>Needs attention</h2></div><button class="text-action" onclick="navigate('Findings')">Open findings <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></button></div>${f.filter(x=>x.status==='Open').slice(0,4).map(x=>`<button class="attention-row" onclick="detail('findings','${x.id}')"><span class="attention-priority ${String(x.severity||'').toLowerCase()}"></span><span class="row-main"><b>${esc(x.title)}</b><small>${esc(x.description)}</small></span>${status(x.severity)}</button>`).join('')||empty('No open findings. The workspace has no current attention items.')}</section><section class="card demo-card"><span class="demo-orbit" aria-hidden="true">◎</span><span class="eyebrow">GUIDED WALKTHROUGH</span><h2>Explore the investigation flow</h2><p>Review fictional evidence, examine relationships, and see how approval and verification stay separate.</p>${btn('Start guided demo <span aria-hidden="true">→</span>','startDemo()','primary')}</section></div>`
}
function entityName(id){for(const k of ['assets','findings','events','investigations']){let x=byId(k,id);if(x)return x.name||x.title||id}return id}
function empty(s){return `<div class="empty">${esc(s)}</div>`}
function toolsBar(search=true,filters=''){return `<div class="toolbar">${search?`<input placeholder="Filter this list…" value="${esc(state.localQuery||'')}" oninput="localFilter(this.value)" aria-label="Filter list">`:''}${filters}</div>`}
function filtered(rows,...keys){let q=(state.localQuery||state.query||'').toLowerCase();return rows.filter(x=>!q||keys.some(k=>String(x[k]||'').toLowerCase().includes(q)))}
function assetsPage(){
  let rows=sortRows(filtered(state.data.assets||[],'name','type','owner','software','criticality','status','observed'),'assets');
  rows=rows.filter(x=>!state.critical||x.criticality===state.critical);
  return `${head('Assets','Inventory and ownership for monitored devices and applications.',btn('+ Add asset','assetForm()','primary'))}${toolsBar(true,`<select aria-label="Filter by criticality" onchange="filterCritical(this.value)"><option value="">All criticality</option>${['Critical','High','Medium','Low'].map(x=>`<option ${state.critical===x?'selected':''}>${x}</option>`).join('')}</select>`)}<div class="table-meta"><span>${rows.length} assets</span><span>Click a column heading to sort</span></div><div class="table-wrap"><table class="table"><thead><tr><th>${sortHeader('Asset','assets','name')}</th><th>${sortHeader('Type / owner','assets','owner')}</th><th>${sortHeader('Criticality','assets','criticality')}</th><th>${sortHeader('Status','assets','status')}</th><th>Findings</th><th>${sortHeader('Last observed','assets','observed')}</th></tr></thead><tbody>${rows.map(x=>`<tr><td><button class="link" onclick="detail('assets','${x.id}')">${esc(x.name)}</button><div class="muted">${esc(x.software)}</div></td><td>${esc(x.type)}<div class="muted">${esc(x.owner)}</div></td><td>${status(x.criticality)}</td><td>${status(x.status)}</td><td>${(state.data.findings||[]).filter(f=>f.assetId===x.id).length}</td><td>${esc(x.observed)}</td></tr>`).join('')||'<tr><td colspan="6">No assets match these filters.</td></tr>'}</tbody></table></div>`
}
function findingsPage(){
  let rows=sortRows(filtered(state.data.findings||[],'title','description','severity','status','assetId','detected'),'findings');
  rows=rows.filter(x=>(!state.severity||x.severity===state.severity)&&(!state.findStatus||x.status===state.findStatus));
  return `${head('Security findings','Signals needing context and review. A finding is not proof of compromise.',btn('+ New investigation','investigationForm()','primary'))}${toolsBar(true,`<select aria-label="Filter by severity" onchange="state.severity=this.value;render()"><option value="">All severity</option>${['Critical','High','Medium','Low'].map(x=>`<option ${state.severity===x?'selected':''}>${x}</option>`).join('')}</select><select aria-label="Filter by finding status" onchange="state.findStatus=this.value;render()"><option value="">All status</option>${['Open','Under review','Resolved'].map(x=>`<option ${state.findStatus===x?'selected':''}>${x}</option>`).join('')}</select>`)}<div class="table-meta"><span>${rows.length} findings</span><span>Click a column heading to sort</span></div><div class="table-wrap"><table class="table"><thead><tr><th>${sortHeader('Finding','findings','title')}</th><th>${sortHeader('Severity','findings','severity')}</th><th>${sortHeader('Status','findings','status')}</th><th>Asset</th><th>Source</th><th>Reliability</th><th></th></tr></thead><tbody>${rows.map(x=>`<tr><td><button class="link" onclick="detail('findings','${x.id}')">${esc(x.title)}</button><div class="muted">${esc(x.detected)}</div></td><td>${status(x.severity)}</td><td>${status(x.status)}</td><td>${esc(entityName(x.assetId))}</td><td>${esc(x.source)}</td><td>${esc(x.reliability)}</td><td>${btn('Investigate',`investigationForm('${x.id}')`,'small')}</td></tr>`).join('')||'<tr><td colspan="7">No findings match these filters.</td></tr>'}</tbody></table></div>`
}
function eventsPage(){
  let rows=filtered(state.data.events||[],'name','type','description','assetId','severity','time');
  const all=state.data.events||[],types=[...new Set(all.map(x=>x.type).filter(Boolean))],dates=[...new Set(all.map(x=>String(x.time||'').slice(0,10)).filter(x=>/^\d{4}-\d{2}-\d{2}$/.test(x)))].sort().reverse();
  rows=rows.filter(x=>(!state.eventType||x.type===state.eventType)&&(!state.eventSeverity||x.severity===state.eventSeverity)&&(!state.eventDate||String(x.time||'').slice(0,10)===state.eventDate));
  rows=sortRows(rows,'events');
  return `${head('Security events','Review recorded signals with their timestamps, assets, and evidence references.')}<div class="toolbar data-toolbar"><label class="filter-search">⌕<input placeholder="Search event records…" value="${esc(state.localQuery||'')}" oninput="localFilter(this.value)" aria-label="Search events"></label><select aria-label="Filter by event type" onchange="state.eventType=this.value;render()"><option value="">All event types</option>${types.map(x=>`<option ${state.eventType===x?'selected':''}>${esc(x)}</option>`).join('')}</select><select aria-label="Filter by severity" onchange="state.eventSeverity=this.value;render()"><option value="">All severities</option>${['Critical','High','Medium','Low'].map(x=>`<option ${state.eventSeverity===x?'selected':''}>${x}</option>`).join('')}</select><select aria-label="Filter by recorded date" onchange="state.eventDate=this.value;render()"><option value="">All recorded dates</option>${dates.map(x=>`<option value="${x}" ${state.eventDate===x?'selected':''}>${x}</option>`).join('')}</select><label class="sort-select">Sort<select aria-label="Sort events" onchange="setSort('events',this.value)"><option value="time:desc" ${state.sorts.events?.key==='time'&&state.sorts.events?.direction==='desc'?'selected':''}>Newest first</option><option value="time:asc" ${state.sorts.events?.key==='time'&&state.sorts.events?.direction==='asc'?'selected':''}>Oldest first</option><option value="severity:asc" ${state.sorts.events?.key==='severity'?'selected':''}>Severity</option></select></label>${state.eventType||state.eventSeverity||state.eventDate?'<button class="btn small" onclick="clearEventFilters()">Clear filters</button>':''}</div><div class="event-summary"><span>${rows.length} <small>matching records</small></span><span>Showing API data only</span></div><div class="card event-stream">${rows.map(x=>`<button class="event-stream-row" onclick="detail('events','${x.id}')"><span class="event-marker ${String(x.severity||'').toLowerCase()}"></span><span class="event-time">${esc(x.time)}</span><span class="event-stream-main"><b>${esc(x.name)}</b><small>${esc(entityName(x.assetId))} · ${esc(x.type)}<br>${esc(x.description)}<br><span class="evidence-inline">Evidence: ${esc(x.evidence)}</span></small></span>${status(x.severity)}<span class="row-chevron" aria-hidden="true">›</span></button>`).join('')||empty('No event records match these filters.')}</div>`
}
function graph(){let nodes=[],edges=(state.data.correlations||[]).filter(e=>state.correlationFilter==='All'||e.classification===state.correlationFilter);for(let c of edges){for(let eid of [c.source,c.target])if(!nodes.some(n=>n.id===eid)){let typ=['AST',''].some(t=>eid.startsWith('AST'))?'asset':eid.startsWith('EV')?'event':'finding';nodes.push({id:eid,type:typ,label:entityName(eid)})}}let w=760,h=380,cx=w/2,cy=h/2;let pos=nodes.map((n,i)=>({...n,x:cx+Math.cos(i*2*Math.PI/nodes.length-Math.PI/2)*Math.min(245,100+nodes.length*12),y:cy+Math.sin(i*2*Math.PI/nodes.length-Math.PI/2)*120}));let at=id=>pos.find(n=>n.id===id);return `<svg viewBox="0 0 ${w} ${h}" style="transform:scale(${state.graphScale});transform-origin:center">${edges.filter(e=>at(e.source)&&at(e.target)).map(e=>{let a=at(e.source),b=at(e.target);return `<line class="edge ${e.classification.toLowerCase()}" x1="${a.x}" y1="${a.y}" x2="${b.x}" y2="${b.y}" role="button" tabindex="0" aria-label="${esc(entityName(e.source))} to ${esc(entityName(e.target))}, ${esc(e.classification)}" onclick="selectCorrelation('${e.id}')" onkeydown="if(event.key==='Enter'||event.key===' '){event.preventDefault();selectCorrelation('${e.id}')}"/>`}).join('')}${pos.map(n=>`<g class="node ${n.type}" role="button" tabindex="0" aria-label="${n.type}: ${esc(n.label)}" onclick="selectNode('${n.id}')" onkeydown="if(event.key==='Enter'||event.key===' '){event.preventDefault();selectNode('${n.id}')}"><circle cx="${n.x}" cy="${n.y}" r="31"/><text x="${n.x}" y="${n.y+48}">${esc(n.label.slice(0,19))}</text><text x="${n.x}" y="${n.y+4}" style="font-size:10px;fill:#9ab1c4">${n.type.toUpperCase()}</text></g>`).join('')}</svg>`}
function correlationsPage(){let rel=(state.data.correlations||[]).filter(c=>state.correlationFilter==='All'||c.classification===state.correlationFilter);let selected=state.selected&&state.selected.startsWith('COR')?byId('correlations',state.selected):null;return `${head('Evidence correlations','Relationships are classified from explicit evidence. Classification describes support for a link, not compromise.',btn('↻ Re-evaluate','runCorrelation()'))}<div class="toolbar">${['All','Verified','Potential','Unsupported'].map(x=>`<button class="btn small ${state.correlationFilter===x?'primary':''}" onclick="state.correlationFilter='${x}';render()">${x}</button>`).join('')}</div><div class="split"><section class="card"><div class="card-title">Evidence graph <div class="graph-toolbar"><button class="btn small" onclick="scaleGraph(1.15)">＋</button><button class="btn small" onclick="scaleGraph(.87)">−</button><button class="btn small" onclick="state.graphScale=1;render()">Fit</button></div></div><div class="graph">${graph()}</div><div class="muted" style="font-size:13px;margin-top:12px">● Asset &nbsp; ● Finding &nbsp; ● Event · solid line: Verified · dashed: Potential · dotted: Unsupported</div></section><aside class="card detail"><h2 class="card-title">${selected?'Relationship evidence':'Select a relationship'}</h2>${selected?correlationDetail(selected):`<p>Choose a relationship from the list or select a graph edge to inspect its rationale and missing evidence.</p>`}</aside></div><section class="card" style="margin-top:16px"><h2 class="card-title">Relationship review <span class="muted" style="font:400 13px 'DM Sans'">${rel.length} relationships</span></h2>${rel.map(c=>`<div class="row"><div class="row-main"><b><button class="link" onclick="selectCorrelation('${c.id}')">${esc(entityName(c.source))} → ${esc(entityName(c.target))}</button></b><small>${esc(c.type)} · ${esc(c.explanation)}</small></div>${status(c.classification)}</div>`).join('')||empty('No relationships match this classification.')}</section>`}
function correlationDetail(c){return `<p>${status(c.classification)} &nbsp; <span class="muted">${esc(c.type)}</span></p><div class="label">Why this classification</div><p>${esc(c.explanation)}</p><div class="label">Supporting evidence</div><ul>${(c.evidence||[]).map(x=>`<li>${esc(x)}</li>`).join('')||'<li>No supporting evidence recorded.</li>'}</ul><div class="label">Missing evidence</div><ul>${(c.missing||[]).map(x=>`<li>${esc(x)}</li>`).join('')||'<li>No missing evidence currently identified.</li>'}</ul><p class="muted">Last evaluated: ${esc(c.evaluated)}</p>`}
function investigationsPage(){let rows=state.data.investigations||[];return `${head('Investigations','Track analyst review, linked evidence, and explicit status changes.',btn('+ Create investigation','investigationForm()','primary'))}${toolsBar(true,`<select onchange="state.invStatus=this.value;render()"><option value="">All statuses</option>${['Open','In Progress','Pending Review','Resolved','Closed'].map(x=>`<option>${x}</option>`).join('')}</select>`)}<div class="grid" style="grid-template-columns:repeat(auto-fit,minmax(280px,1fr))">${rows.filter(x=>(!state.invStatus||x.status===state.invStatus)&&(!state.localQuery||`${x.title} ${x.status} ${x.priority}`.toLowerCase().includes(state.localQuery.toLowerCase()))).map(x=>`<article class="card"><h2 class="card-title">${esc(x.title)}</h2><p>${status(x.status)} &nbsp; ${status(x.priority)}</p><p class="sub">${(x.links||[]).map(l=>esc(entityName(l))).join(' · ')}</p><small class="muted">Updated ${esc(x.updated)}</small><div class="actions" style="margin-top:14px"><button class="btn small" onclick="detail('investigations','${x.id}')">Open investigation</button><button class="btn small" onclick="noteForm('${x.id}')">Add note</button></div></article>`).join('')||empty('No investigations match your filters.')}</div>`}
function workflowRail(r){
  const steps=['Plan review','Approval','Simulation','Verification'];
  const stage=r.status==='Pending Approval'?0:r.status==='Approved'?1:r.status==='Verification Pending'?2:['Verified','Failed','Requires Review'].includes(r.status)?3:0;
  const rejected=r.status==='Rejected';
  return `<div class="workflow-rail ${rejected?'is-rejected':''}" aria-label="Remediation workflow status">${steps.map((label,i)=>`<div class="workflow-step ${i<stage||(!rejected&&i===stage&&stage===3&&r.status==='Verified')?'complete':!rejected&&i===stage?'current':''}"><span class="workflow-index">${i<stage||(!rejected&&i===stage&&stage===3&&r.status==='Verified')?'✓':i+1}</span><span>${label}</span></div>`).join('')}</div>${rejected?'<p class="workflow-note">Plan rejected. No simulated execution was recorded.</p>':r.approver?`<p class="workflow-note">Approval recorded for ${esc(r.approver)}${r.decisionAt?` · ${esc(r.decisionAt)}`:''}. Simulation remains separate from verification.</p>`:''}`
}
function remediationPage(){
  let rows=state.data.remediations||[];
  return `${head('Remediation review','Review each proposal carefully. Approval, simulated execution, and verification remain separate decisions.')}<div class="workflow-intro"><span class="workflow-shield">◇</span><div><b>Human approval required</b><small>Every action is a simulation record only. No device configuration changes.</small></div></div>${rows.map(r=>`<article class="card remediation-card"><div class="remediation-heading"><div><div class="eyebrow">${esc(r.id)} · ${esc(r.findingTitle||entityName(r.findingId))}</div><h2>${esc(r.title)}</h2></div>${status(r.status)}</div>${workflowRail(r)}<p class="remediation-action">${esc(r.action)}</p><div class="remediation-facts"><div><span>Expected benefit</span><p>${esc(r.benefit)}</p></div><div><span>Potential impact & risks</span><p>${esc(r.impact)} ${esc(r.risks)}</p></div><div><span>Preconditions</span><p>${esc(r.preconditions)}</p></div><div><span>Verification criteria</span><p>${esc(r.criteria)}</p></div></div>${r.result?`<div class="workflow-result"><span>Recorded outcome</span><p>${esc(r.result)}</p></div>`:''}<div class="actions remediation-actions">${r.status==='Pending Approval'?btn('Review & decide',`approvalForm('${r.id}')`,'primary'):''}${r.status==='Approved'?btn('Simulate execution',`executeRemediation('${r.id}')`,'primary'):''}${r.status==='Verification Pending'?btn('Verify outcome',`verifyForm('${r.id}')`,'primary'):''}</div></article>`).join('')||empty('No remediation plans are available.')}`
}
function auditPage(){
  let rows=sortRows((state.data.audit||[]).slice().reverse(),'audit');
  rows=rows.filter(x=>(!state.auditOrigin||x.origin===state.auditOrigin)&&(!state.localQuery||JSON.stringify(x).toLowerCase().includes(state.localQuery.toLowerCase())));
  return `${head('Audit trail','Persisted workspace activity, including analyst decisions and recorded system events.')}${toolsBar(true,`<select aria-label="Filter audit origin" onchange="state.auditOrigin=this.value;render()"><option value="">All origins</option><option ${state.auditOrigin==='User'?'selected':''}>User</option><option ${state.auditOrigin==='System'?'selected':''}>System</option></select>`)}<div class="table-meta"><span>${rows.length} audit entries</span><span>Click a column heading to sort</span></div><div class="table-wrap"><table class="table"><thead><tr><th>${sortHeader('Time','audit','time')}</th><th>${sortHeader('Actor','audit','actor')}</th><th>${sortHeader('Action','audit','action')}</th><th>${sortHeader('Entity','audit','entityType')}</th><th>Description</th><th>${sortHeader('Origin','audit','origin')}</th></tr></thead><tbody>${rows.map(x=>`<tr><td>${esc(x.time)}</td><td>${esc(x.actor)}</td><td>${esc(x.action)}</td><td>${esc(x.entityType)} · ${esc(x.entityId)}</td><td>${esc(x.description)}</td><td>${esc(x.origin)}</td></tr>`).join('')||'<tr><td colspan="6">No audit entries match.</td></tr>'}</tbody></table></div>`
}
function settingsPage(){let s=state.data.settings?.[0]||{};return `${head('Settings','Workspace configuration and demo data management.')}<div class="grid cols"><section class="card"><h2 class="card-title">Workspace configuration</h2><div class="field"><label>Workspace name</label><input id="setName" value="${esc(s.name||'')}"></div><div class="field"><label>Organization</label><input id="setOrg" value="${esc(s.organization||'')}"></div><div class="field"><label>Correlation time window (hours)</label><input id="setWindow" type="number" min="1" max="720" value="${esc(s.windowHours||24)}"></div><div class="field"><label>Verified rule</label><input id="setVerified" value="${esc(s.verifiedRule||'')}"></div><div class="field"><label>Potential rule</label><input id="setPotential" value="${esc(s.potentialRule||'')}"></div><p>Simulation mode: <b>${s.simulationMode?'Enabled':'Disabled'}</b>. This demo does not connect to real systems.</p>${btn('Save settings','saveSettings()','primary')}</section><section class="card"><h2 class="card-title">Demo data</h2><p class="sub">Restore the Northstar Dental Clinic fictional seed workspace. This permanently replaces current local demo records.</p>${btn('Reset demo workspace','confirmReset()','danger')}<hr style="border-color:var(--line);margin:25px 0"><h2 class="card-title">API health</h2><p>Process liveness and database readiness are checked separately.</p>${btn('Check health','checkHealth()')}</section></div>`}
function aboutPage(){return `${head('About CyberRakshak AI','Evidence-led security triage and safe remediation guidance for small organizations.')}<div class="grid cols"><section class="card"><h2 class="card-title">Understand the evidence before acting</h2><p>CyberRakshak helps small businesses organize available assets, findings, and events into explainable investigations. Correlations show what supports a relationship, what is missing, and why records should remain separate.</p><p>It is intended for small-business owners and analysts who need a practical starting point for security review. It uses transparent correlation rules, not unsupported AI claims.</p><h3>Simulation-only behavior</h3><p>All data in this workspace is fictional. Correlation is local to the supplied dataset. No network scans run; no endpoint, firewall, or application is changed. Remediation execution records a simulated result only.</p><h3>Limitations</h3><p>Analysis may be incomplete or inaccurate. The sample evidence is not a substitute for forensic work or a qualified cybersecurity professional. A verified relationship means evidence supports a connection, not that compromise occurred.</p></section><section class="card"><h2 class="card-title">Disclaimer</h2><div class="disclaimer">${DISCLAIMER}</div><p style="margin-top:16px">This disclaimer is available here at any time. It is also presented during the guided demo before investigation begins.</p></section></div>`}
function render(){let app=$('#app');if(app)app.innerHTML=shell()}
function navigate(p){state.page=p;state.menu=false;state.localQuery='';render()}
function toggleMenu(){state.menu=!state.menu;render()}
function toggleSidebar(){state.sidebarCollapsed=!state.sidebarCollapsed;render()}
function sortRows(rows,scope){let cfg=state.sorts[scope];if(!cfg)return rows;return rows.slice().sort((a,b)=>{let av=String(a[cfg.key]??''),bv=String(b[cfg.key]??'');let n=av.localeCompare(bv,undefined,{numeric:true,sensitivity:'base'});return cfg.direction==='desc'?-n:n})}
function setSort(scope,value){let [key,direction]=value.split(':');state.sorts[scope]={key,direction};render()}
function sortHeader(label,scope,key){let active=state.sorts[scope]?.key===key,dir=active?state.sorts[scope].direction:'asc';return `<button class="sort-heading" onclick="setSort('${scope}','${key}:${active&&dir==='asc'?'desc':'asc'}')" aria-label="Sort by ${label}">${label}<span aria-hidden="true">${active?(dir==='asc'?'↑':'↓'):'↕'}</span></button>`}
function globalSearch(v){state.query=v;render();let i=$('.search');i?.focus();i?.setSelectionRange(v.length,v.length)}
function localFilter(v){state.localQuery=v;let p=state.page;render();let i=$('.toolbar input');i?.focus();i?.setSelectionRange(v.length,v.length)}
function filterCritical(v){state.critical=v;render()}
function scaleGraph(v){state.graphScale=Math.max(.65,Math.min(1.6,state.graphScale*v));render()}
function selectCorrelation(id){state.selected=id;render()}
function selectNode(id){let c=(state.data.correlations||[]).find(x=>x.source===id||x.target===id);if(c){state.selected=c.id;render()}else detail(id.startsWith('EV')?'events':id.startsWith('AST')?'assets':'findings',id)}
function formModal(title,body,onSave,label='Save'){modal(`<h2>${title}</h2>${body}<div id="formError" class="alert" style="display:none;margin-top:12px"></div><div class="modal-actions"><button class="btn" onclick="closeModal()">Cancel</button><button class="btn primary" onclick="${onSave}">${label}</button></div>`)}
function modal(content,drawer=false){$('#modal-root').innerHTML=`<div class="modal-backdrop ${drawer?'drawer-backdrop':''}" onclick="if(event.target===this)closeModal()"><section class="modal ${drawer?'detail-drawer':''}" role="dialog" aria-modal="true" aria-label="${drawer?'Record details':'Workspace dialog'}" tabindex="-1">${content}</section></div>`;$('.modal')?.focus()}
function showOnboarding(){modal(`<div class="eyebrow">WELCOME · SIMULATION WORKSPACE</div><h2>Welcome to CyberRakshak AI</h2><p>This Northstar Dental Clinic workspace contains fictional assets and simulated evidence. You can inspect relationships, create investigations, and review remediation decisions. No real-world security operation is performed.</p><h3>Disclaimer</h3><div class="disclaimer">${DISCLAIMER}</div><div class="modal-actions"><button class="btn primary" onclick="localStorage.setItem('cr-onboarded','yes');closeModal()">Continue to workspace</button></div>`)}
function closeModal(){if(state.demo?.waiting){state.demo.waiting=false;demoShow();return}$('#modal-root').innerHTML=''}
function demoOpenDetail(kind,rid){state.demo.waiting=true;$('#modal-root').innerHTML='';detail(kind,rid)}
function demoOpenPage(page){state.demo.waiting=true;state.page=page;render()}
function demoRemediationAction(){let r=byId('remediations','REM-401');state.demo.waiting=true;$('#modal-root').innerHTML='';if(r.status==='Approved')executeRemediation(r.id);else if(r.status==='Verification Pending')verifyForm(r.id);else{state.demo.waiting=false;demoOpenPage('Remediation')}}
function resumeDemo(){if(!state.demo)return;state.demo.waiting=false;state.demo.step=Math.min(state.demo.step+1,demoSteps.length-1);demoShow()}
function detail(kind,rid){let x=byId(kind,rid);if(!x)return;let title=x.name||x.title||x.id, body='';if(kind==='assets'){body=`<p>${status(x.criticality)} &nbsp; ${status(x.status)}</p><p>${esc(x.type)} · ${esc(x.owner)} · ${esc(x.software)}</p><p>Last observed: ${esc(x.observed)}</p><h3>Associated findings</h3>${(state.data.findings||[]).filter(f=>f.assetId===x.id).map(f=>`<p><button class="link" onclick="closeModal();detail('findings','${f.id}')">${esc(f.title)}</button></p>`).join('')||'<p>No linked findings.</p>'}<h3>Related evidence</h3>${(state.data.events||[]).filter(e=>e.assetId===x.id).map(e=>`<p>${esc(e.id)} · ${esc(e.evidence)}</p>`).join('')||'<p>No related events.</p>'}<div class="modal-actions">${btn('Edit asset',`assetForm('${x.id}')`)}${btn('Delete asset',`deleteAsset('${x.id}')`,'danger')}</div>`}else if(kind==='findings'){body=`<p>${status(x.severity)} &nbsp; ${status(x.status)}</p><p>${esc(x.description)}</p><p>Asset: <button class="link" onclick="closeModal();detail('assets','${x.assetId}')">${esc(entityName(x.assetId))}</button> · ${esc(x.source)}</p><p>Detected ${esc(x.detected)} · reliability ${esc(x.reliability)}</p><h3>Supporting evidence</h3>${(x.evidence||[]).map(e=>`<p><button class="link" onclick="closeModal();detail('events','${e}')">${e}</button> · ${esc(byId('events',e)?.description||'evidence reference')}</p>`).join('')}<h3>Recommended next step</h3><p>${esc(x.next)}</p><div class="modal-actions">${btn('Create investigation',`closeModal();investigationForm('${x.id}')`,'primary')}${btn('Review finding',`findingStatusForm('${x.id}')`)}</div>`}else if(kind==='events'){body=`<p>${status(x.severity)} &nbsp; ${esc(x.type)} · reliability ${esc(x.reliability)}</p><p>${esc(x.description)}</p><p>Asset: <button class="link" onclick="closeModal();detail('assets','${x.assetId}')">${esc(entityName(x.assetId))}</button></p><h3>Evidence reference</h3><p>${esc(x.evidence)}</p><h3>Related finding</h3>${(state.data.findings||[]).filter(f=>(f.evidence||[]).includes(x.id)).map(f=>`<p><button class="link" onclick="closeModal();detail('findings','${f.id}')">${esc(f.title)}</button></p>`).join('')||'<p>No directly linked finding.</p>'}`}else if(kind==='investigations'){body=`<p>${status(x.status)} &nbsp; ${status(x.priority)} · created by ${esc(x.createdBy)}</p><h3>Linked entities</h3>${(x.links||[]).map(z=>`<p>${esc(z)} · ${esc(entityName(z))}</p>`).join('')}<h3>Notes</h3>${(x.notes||[]).map(n=>`<p>${esc(n.by)} · ${esc(n.time)}<br>${esc(n.text)}</p>`).join('')||'<p>No analyst notes.</p>'}<h3>Next step</h3><p>${esc(x.next)}</p><div class="field"><label>Update status</label><select id="invNewStatus">${['Open','In Progress','Pending Review','Resolved','Closed'].map(s=>`<option ${s===x.status?'selected':''}>${s}</option>`).join('')}</select></div><div class="modal-actions">${btn('Add note',`noteForm('${x.id}')`)}${btn('Save status',`updateInvestigation('${x.id}')`,'primary')}</div>`}modal(`<div class="drawer-kicker">RECORD DETAIL</div><h2>${esc(title)}</h2>${body}<div class="modal-actions"><button class="btn" onclick="closeModal()">Close</button></div>`,true)}
function assetForm(rid){let x=rid?byId('assets',rid):{};formModal(rid?'Edit asset':'Add asset',`<div class="field"><label>Asset name</label><input id="aName" value="${esc(x.name||'')}"></div><div class="field"><label>Asset type</label><select id="aType">${['Workstation','Server','Network device','Application'].map(v=>`<option ${v===x.type?'selected':''}>${v}</option>`).join('')}</select></div><div class="field"><label>Owner / department</label><input id="aOwner" value="${esc(x.owner||'')}"></div><div class="field"><label>Software / operating system</label><input id="aSoftware" value="${esc(x.software||'')}"></div><div class="field"><label>Criticality</label><select id="aCritical">${['Low','Medium','High','Critical'].map(v=>`<option ${v===x.criticality?'selected':''}>${v}</option>`).join('')}</select></div>`,`saveAsset('${rid||''}')`)}
async function saveAsset(rid){let name=$('#aName').value.trim(),owner=$('#aOwner').value.trim();if(!name||!owner)return showFormError('Asset name and owner are required.');let x={id:rid||id('AST'),name,type:$('#aType').value,owner,software:$('#aSoftware').value.trim(),criticality:$('#aCritical').value,status:'Monitored',observed:now()};if(rid){let old=byId('assets',rid);x={...old,...x}}await save('assets',x);closeModal()}
function showFormError(s){let e=$('#formError');e.textContent=s;e.style.display='block'}
function investigationForm(findingId=''){let f=byId('findings',findingId);formModal('Create investigation',`<div class="field"><label>Investigation title</label><input id="iTitle" value="${esc(f?'Review '+f.title:'')}"></div><div class="field"><label>Priority</label><select id="iPriority">${['Critical','High','Medium','Low'].map(v=>`<option ${v===(f?.severity||'Medium')?'selected':''}>${v}</option>`).join('')}</select></div><div class="field"><label>Linked finding</label><select id="iFinding"><option value="">Choose a finding</option>${(state.data.findings||[]).map(v=>`<option value="${v.id}" ${v.id===findingId?'selected':''}>${esc(v.title)}</option>`).join('')}</select></div><p class="muted">The affected asset and supporting events are linked automatically when a finding is selected.</p>`,`createInvestigation()`)}
async function createInvestigation(){let f=byId('findings',$('#iFinding').value),title=$('#iTitle').value.trim();if(!title)return showFormError('Enter an investigation title.');let links=f?[f.id,f.assetId,...(f.evidence||[])]:[];await save('investigations',{id:id('INV'),title,status:'Open',priority:$('#iPriority').value,links,notes:[],createdBy:'Workspace analyst',created:new Date().toISOString(),updated:new Date().toISOString(),next:f?.next||'Gather and review supporting evidence.'});closeModal();navigate('Investigations')}
function noteForm(rid){let inv=byId('investigations',rid);closeModal();formModal('Add analyst note',`<p>${esc(inv?.title)}</p><div class="field"><label>Note</label><textarea id="noteText" placeholder="Record what was reviewed and what remains unknown"></textarea></div>`,`addNote('${rid}')`)}
async function addNote(rid){let text=$('#noteText').value.trim();if(!text)return showFormError('Enter a note.');let x=byId('investigations',rid);x.notes=[...(x.notes||[]),{by:'Workspace analyst',time:new Date().toISOString(),text}];x.updated=new Date().toISOString();await save('investigations',x);closeModal();detail('investigations',rid)}
async function updateInvestigation(rid){let x=byId('investigations',rid),old=x.status,next=$('#invNewStatus').value;if(next==='Resolved'&&old!=='Resolved'){closeModal();formModal('Resolve investigation',`<div class="alert">Resolution is an explicit analyst decision. Record what verification was reviewed before marking this investigation resolved.</div><div class="field"><label>Verification reviewed</label><textarea id="resolveEvidence" placeholder="What evidence supports resolution? What limitations remain?"></textarea></div>`,`confirmResolve('${rid}')`,'Record resolution')}else{x.status=next;x.updated=new Date().toISOString();await api('investigations',{method:'POST',body:JSON.stringify({...x,_action:'status changed',_description:`Investigation status changed from ${old} to ${next}`})});await refresh();detail('investigations',rid)}}
async function confirmResolve(rid){let note=$('#resolveEvidence').value.trim();if(!note)return showFormError('Record the verification evidence and remaining limitations.');let x=byId('investigations',rid),old=x.status;x.status='Resolved';x.notes=[...(x.notes||[]),{by:'Workspace analyst',time:new Date().toISOString(),text:`Resolution verification: ${note}`}];x.updated=new Date().toISOString();await api('investigations',{method:'POST',body:JSON.stringify({...x,_action:'status changed',_description:`Investigation status changed from ${old} to Resolved after verification was recorded`})});await refresh();closeModal();detail('investigations',rid)}
function findingStatusForm(rid){let x=byId('findings',rid);formModal('Update finding status',`<p>${esc(x.title)}</p><div class="field"><label>Status</label><select id="findingStatus">${['Open','Under review','Resolved'].map(s=>`<option ${s===x.status?'selected':''}>${s}</option>`).join('')}</select></div><p class="muted">Resolution is a user-recorded status and does not remove original evidence.</p>`,`saveFindingStatus('${rid}')`)}
async function saveFindingStatus(rid){let x=byId('findings',rid),old=x.status;x.status=$('#findingStatus').value;await api('findings',{method:'POST',body:JSON.stringify({...x,_action:'status changed',_description:`Finding status changed from ${old} to ${x.status}`})});await refresh();closeModal()}
async function deleteAsset(rid){closeModal();formModal('Delete asset?',`<div class="alert">Delete ${esc(entityName(rid))}? This action cannot be undone. Assets with linked events or findings cannot be deleted.</div>`,`doDeleteAsset('${rid}')`,'Confirm delete')}
async function doDeleteAsset(rid){try{await api('assets/'+rid,{method:'DELETE'});await refresh();closeModal()}catch(e){showFormError(e.message)}}
function approvalForm(rid){let r=byId('remediations',rid);formModal('Review remediation plan',`<div class="alert">Simulation only. No device configuration will change.</div><h3>${esc(r.title)}</h3><p>${esc(r.action)}</p><p><b>Potential impact:</b> ${esc(r.impact)}</p><p><b>Risks:</b> ${esc(r.risks)}</p><p><b>Preconditions:</b> ${esc(r.preconditions)}</p><div class="field"><label>Approver name</label><input id="approver" placeholder="Your name"></div><label style="display:flex;gap:9px;align-items:flex-start;line-height:1.5"><input id="ack" type="checkbox" style="margin-top:4px"> I reviewed the proposed action, impact, and risks, and approve a simulated execution record.</label><div class="actions" style="margin-top:13px">${btn('Reject plan',`decideRemediation('${rid}','Rejected')`,'danger')}</div>`,`decideRemediation('${rid}','Approved')`,'Approve simulation')}
async function decideRemediation(rid,decision){let r=byId('remediations',rid);if(decision==='Approved'){let n=$('#approver')?.value.trim();if(!n)return showFormError('Enter the approver name.');if(!$('#ack')?.checked)return showFormError('Acknowledge the impact and simulation scope before approval.');r.approver=n}r.status=decision;r.decisionAt=new Date().toISOString();r.result=decision==='Approved'?'Approved for simulated execution.':'Rejected by reviewer.';await api('remediations',{method:'POST',body:JSON.stringify({...r,_action:`remediation ${decision.toLowerCase()}`,_description:`${decision} remediation ${rid}${r.approver?' by '+r.approver:''}`})});await refresh();closeModal()}
async function executeRemediation(rid){let r=byId('remediations',rid);formModal('Simulate execution',`<div class="alert">This records a simulated outcome only. Nothing will be sent to a device.</div><p>${esc(r.action)}</p><p>Approval recorded by ${esc(r.approver)}.</p><p>Execution will not mark this plan verified. Verification is a separate step.</p>`,`confirmExecution('${rid}')`,'Record simulated execution')}
async function confirmExecution(rid){let r=byId('remediations',rid);r.status='Verification Pending';r.executedAt=new Date().toISOString();r.result='Simulation recorded. Verification is pending.';await api('remediations',{method:'POST',body:JSON.stringify({...r,_action:'simulated execution recorded',_description:`Simulated execution recorded for ${rid}; no system was changed`})});await refresh();closeModal()}
function verifyForm(rid){let r=byId('remediations',rid);formModal('Verify simulated outcome',`<p><b>Criteria:</b> ${esc(r.criteria)}</p><p><b>Available evidence:</b> ${esc((r.evidence||[]).join('; ')||'No post-action evidence has been collected. Review the criteria before recording a result.')}</p><div class="field"><label>Verification result</label><select id="verifyResult"><option value="pass">Criteria met in simulated review</option><option value="fail">Criteria not met</option><option value="review">Insufficient evidence · requires review</option></select></div><div class="field"><label>What was checked?</label><textarea id="verifyNote" placeholder="Describe the evidence reviewed"></textarea></div><p class="muted">The simulated action itself is not proof that the finding was fixed.</p>`,`verifyRemediation('${rid}')`,'Record verification')}
async function verifyRemediation(rid){let r=byId('remediations',rid),result=$('#verifyResult').value,note=$('#verifyNote').value.trim();if(!note)return showFormError('Describe what was checked.');r.status=result==='pass'?'Verified':result==='fail'?'Failed':'Requires Review';r.verifiedAt=new Date().toISOString();r.result=`${result==='pass'?'Criteria passed':result==='fail'?'Criteria not met':'Insufficient evidence'}: ${note}`;r.evidence=note;await api('remediations',{method:'POST',body:JSON.stringify({...r,_action:'verification recorded',_description:`${r.status} verification for ${rid}: ${note}`})});await refresh();closeModal()}
async function runCorrelation(){let rows=state.data.correlations||[];let stamp=new Date().toISOString();for(let c of rows){c.evaluated=stamp;await api('correlations',{method:'POST',body:JSON.stringify({...c,_action:'relationship re-evaluated',_description:`Re-evaluated ${c.id}: ${c.classification}; evidence and missing evidence retained`})})}await refresh();state.page='Correlations';render()}
async function saveSettings(){let s=state.data.settings[0],w=Number($('#setWindow').value),name=$('#setName').value.trim();if(!name||!Number.isInteger(w)||w<1||w>720)return modal(`<h2>Check settings</h2><p>Workspace name is required and the time window must be between 1 and 720 whole hours.</p><div class="modal-actions"><button class="btn" onclick="closeModal()">Close</button></div>`);let x={...s,name,organization:$('#setOrg').value.trim(),windowHours:w,verifiedRule:$('#setVerified').value.trim(),potentialRule:$('#setPotential').value.trim()};await api('settings',{method:'POST',body:JSON.stringify({...x,_action:'settings updated',_description:'Workspace configuration updated'})});await refresh()}
function confirmReset(){formModal('Reset demo workspace?',`<div class="alert">This replaces local workspace records with the fictional Northstar Dental Clinic demo dataset. The reset action is recorded in the audit trail after seed data is restored.</div><p>Assets, findings, events, investigations, and remediation decisions will return to their original demo state.</p>`,`doReset()`,'Reset workspace')}
async function doReset(){await api('reset',{method:'POST',body:'{}'});await refresh();closeModal()}
async function checkHealth(){try{let a=await fetch(`${API_BASE}/api/live`).then(x=>x.json()),b=await fetch(`${API_BASE}/api/ready`).then(x=>x.json());modal(`<h2>API health</h2><p>Process liveness: <b>${esc(a.status)}</b></p><p>Database readiness: <b>${esc(b.status)}</b> · ${esc(b.database)}</p><div class="modal-actions"><button class="btn" onclick="closeModal()">Close</button></div>`)}catch(e){modal(`<h2>API health</h2><p class="alert">Health check failed: ${esc(e.message)}</p><div class="modal-actions"><button class="btn" onclick="closeModal()">Close</button></div>`)} }
const demoSteps=[['Welcome','We are reviewing fictional security signals for Northstar Dental Clinic. The workspace uses simulated assets and events. No real systems are contacted.'],['Assets','Five fictional clinic assets are monitored. We will follow an authentication signal on the clinical server.'],['Finding','The repeated SSH failures deserve review, but failed attempts alone do not show that anyone gained access.'],['Evidence','Two simulated authentication events show repeated failures from one source. The sample contains no successful login.'],['Correlation','The events support the finding on the same server. A separate possible link remains unsupported because there is no shared identity or session evidence.'],['Investigation','An investigation links the finding, its asset, and its event records so an analyst can track what to check next.'],['Remediation','The suggested allowlist review has possible availability impact. A human approver must assess the preconditions and explicitly approve or reject.'],['Execution','After approval, execution creates a simulated record only. It does not change server settings.'],['Verification','Verification is separate and uses criteria plus analyst-entered evidence. Approval or execution alone does not verify the outcome.'],['Audit','Persisted audit entries show the decisions and simulated steps actually recorded. The final summary reflects these current records.']];
function startDemo(){state.demo={step:0};demoShow()}
function demoShow(){let d=state.demo;if(!d)return;let [title,text]=demoSteps[d.step],progress=demoSteps.map((_,i)=>`<i class="${i<=d.step?'done':''}"></i>`).join('');let actions=d.step===0?`<button class="btn" onclick="closeDemo()">Exit demo</button><button class="btn primary" onclick="demoNext()">Begin walkthrough</button>`:d.step===2?`${btn('Open finding',`demoOpenDetail('findings','FND-101')`)}<button class="btn" onclick="closeDemo()">Exit demo</button><button class="btn primary" onclick="demoNext()">Continue</button>`:d.step===3?`${btn('Open event',`demoOpenDetail('events','EV-201')`)}<button class="btn primary" onclick="demoNext()">Continue</button>`:d.step===4?`${btn('Open correlations',`demoOpenPage('Correlations')`)}<button class="btn primary" onclick="demoNext()">Continue</button>`:d.step===5?`${btn('Open investigation',`demoOpenDetail('investigations','INV-301')`)}<button class="btn primary" onclick="demoNext()">Continue</button>`:d.step===6?`${btn('Open remediation',`demoOpenPage('Remediation')`)}<button class="btn primary" onclick="demoNext()">Continue</button>`:d.step===7?`${btn('Review / approve',`state.demo.waiting=true;document.querySelector('#modal-root').innerHTML='';approvalForm('REM-401')`)}<button class="btn primary" onclick="demoNext()">Continue</button>`:d.step===8?`${btn(byId('remediations','REM-401').status==='Approved'?'Simulate execution':byId('remediations','REM-401').status==='Verification Pending'?'Verify outcome':'Open remediation',`demoRemediationAction()`)}<button class="btn primary" onclick="demoNext()">Continue</button>`:d.step===9?`${btn('View audit trail',`demoOpenPage('Audit Trail')`)}<button class="btn primary" onclick="demoFinish()">Finish and summarize</button>`:`<button class="btn primary" onclick="demoNext()">Continue</button>`;modal(`<div class="eyebrow">GUIDED DEMO · STEP ${d.step+1} OF ${demoSteps.length}</div><div class="steps">${progress}</div><h2>${esc(title)}</h2><p>${esc(text)}</p>${d.step===0?`<div class="disclaimer">${DISCLAIMER}</div>`:''}${d.step===demoSteps.length-1?`<div class="alert">Current record state: remediation is <b>${esc(byId('remediations','REM-401')?.status||'unknown')}</b>. It is only verified when a separate verification has been recorded.</div>`:''}<div class="modal-actions">${actions}</div>`)}
function demoNext(){if(state.demo.step<demoSteps.length-1)state.demo.step++;demoShow()}
function closeDemo(){state.demo=null;closeModal()}
function demoFinish(){state.demo=null;closeModal();navigate('Overview')}
function startNetworkBackdrop(){
  const canvas=$('#network-backdrop'),ctx=canvas?.getContext('2d',{alpha:true});if(!canvas||!ctx)return;
  const reduced=window.matchMedia('(prefers-reduced-motion: reduce)');let width=0,height=0,dpr=1,nodes=[],frame=0,last=0,clock=0;
  function resize(){width=window.innerWidth;height=window.innerHeight;dpr=Math.min(window.devicePixelRatio||1,1.5);canvas.width=Math.floor(width*dpr);canvas.height=Math.floor(height*dpr);canvas.style.width=`${width}px`;canvas.style.height=`${height}px`;ctx.setTransform(dpr,0,0,dpr,0,0);let count=width<700?18:Math.min(46,Math.max(24,Math.round(width/34)));nodes=Array.from({length:count},()=>({x:Math.random()*width,y:Math.random()*height,vx:(Math.random()-.5)*.13,vy:(Math.random()-.5)*.13,r:Math.random()*1.4+.7,phase:Math.random()}));draw(0)}
  function draw(time){ctx.clearRect(0,0,width,height);const reach=width<700?118:164,step=time*.00011;for(let i=0;i<nodes.length;i++){let a=nodes[i];if(!reduced.matches){a.x+=a.vx;a.y+=a.vy;if(a.x<0||a.x>width)a.vx*=-1;if(a.y<0||a.y>height)a.vy*=-1}for(let j=i+1;j<nodes.length;j++){let b=nodes[j],dx=b.x-a.x,dy=b.y-a.y,d=Math.hypot(dx,dy);if(d<reach){let alpha=(1-d/reach)*.13;ctx.strokeStyle=(i+j)%4===0?`rgba(142,166,137,${alpha})`:`rgba(120,184,221,${alpha*.55})`;ctx.lineWidth=.7;ctx.beginPath();ctx.moveTo(a.x,a.y);ctx.lineTo(b.x,b.y);ctx.stroke();if((i*nodes.length+j)%13===0){let t=(a.phase+step*.32)%1;ctx.fillStyle='rgba(120,184,221,.22)';ctx.beginPath();ctx.arc(a.x+dx*t,a.y+dy*t,1.25,0,Math.PI*2);ctx.fill()}}}ctx.fillStyle='rgba(120,184,221,.20)';ctx.beginPath();ctx.arc(a.x,a.y,a.r,0,Math.PI*2);ctx.fill();ctx.fillStyle='rgba(142,166,137,.07)';ctx.beginPath();ctx.arc(a.x,a.y,a.r*3.2,0,Math.PI*2);ctx.fill()}}
  function animate(now){frame=requestAnimationFrame(animate);if(now-last<33)return;last=now;clock=now;draw(clock)}
  function motionChanged(){if(frame)cancelAnimationFrame(frame);frame=0;if(reduced.matches)draw(0);else frame=requestAnimationFrame(animate)}
  resize();window.addEventListener('resize',resize,{passive:true});reduced.addEventListener?.('change',motionChanged);if(!reduced.matches)frame=requestAnimationFrame(animate)
}
document.addEventListener('keydown',e=>{if(e.key==='Escape')closeModal();if((e.ctrlKey||e.metaKey)&&e.key.toLowerCase()==='k'){e.preventDefault();$('.search')?.focus()}if(e.key==='Tab'&&$('.modal')){let f=[...$('.modal').querySelectorAll('button,input,select,textarea,[tabindex]:not([tabindex="-1"])')].filter(x=>!x.disabled),first=f[0],last=f[f.length-1];if(e.shiftKey&&document.activeElement===first){e.preventDefault();last?.focus()}else if(!e.shiftKey&&document.activeElement===last){e.preventDefault();first?.focus()}}});
startNetworkBackdrop();
refresh();
